    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Security &amp; Peace of Mind</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Containers can be tracked in real‑time, and the sealed environment allows for easy inspection at checkpoints without opening the bike. Open trailers require manual checks, increasing handling time and risk.</p>
